violence 1 (SceneRadar: A woman elbows a man - then sets a computer on fire.)

0:10:50.91 --> 0:10:52.29
profane word 2 (jesus christ)

0:13:25.00 --> 0:13:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A tied up and bleeding man is shot dead.)

0:14:45.00 --> 0:15:40.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Bare knuckle boxing match. Bourne knocks out his opponent. We see blood on both the fighters.)

0:17:45.00 --> 0:19:30.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A riot breaks out during protests. The protesters clash with cops - they respond with tear gas.)

0:22:20.00 --> 0:34:40.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Bourne and his associate move through the riots - pursued by some CIA assets. We see explosions, fire, tear gas, water cannons and clashes between riot police and protesters. Bourne knocks a few cops - and steals a bike. The cops chasing him are knocked down by a water cannon. Bourne shoots some men dead. A hit man runs his car in a wall - then continues on foot. He later goes on top of a building - after shooting the residents dead - and shoots Bourne's associate dead. Armed cops spot the hit man - and raid the building.)

0:26:11.95 --> 0:26:12.85
profane word 1 (hell / ass)

0:27:15.90 --> 0:27:16.38
profane word 1 (ass)

0:35:22.77 --> 0:35:23.45
profane word 1 (damn)

0:41:30.41 --> 0:41:31.05
profane word 3 (prick)

0:42:01.34 --> 0:42:01.98
profane word 1 (hell)

0:42:06.18 --> 0:42:06.82
profane word 1 (hell)

0:50:15.00 --> 0:51:20.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see an explosion - and hear screams. A man is badly injured. Later a man attacks Bourne - but he is easily subdued and knocked out.)

0:54:50.00 --> 0:55:00.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Bourne knocks out a man and escapes.)

0:57:49.32 --> 0:57:49.72
profane word 1 (hell)

