violence 2 (SceneRadar: The hit man attacks and shoots dead some CIA agents.)

1:09:52.30 --> 1:09:52.74
profane word 1 (hell)

1:11:00.00 --> 1:14:10.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Bourne shoots a man in the leg for information. He then hangs him from a building's roof. We see a flashback of a car bomb. A hit man arrives and shoots the man dead. Bourne jumps from the roof - and is injured.)

1:11:25.00 --> 1:11:25.66
profane word 2 (goddamn)

