1:30:10.00 --> 1:33:10.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A sniper hits a CEO during a conference. The crowd panics and runs - Bourne chases down the hit man and fires. Agents chase Bourne.)

1:31:56.35 --> 1:31:56.85
profane word 3 (shit)

1:36:45.00 --> 1:37:05.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Bourne is shot - he returns fire and kills the agent. Another man is shot dead by a woman.)

1:39:00.00 --> 1:45:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: The hit man steals an armored truck and escapes. Bourne chases him in a car. The armored truck rams into many cars - including a parking lane - and causes a pile up. Later the truck rams into a casino.)

1:45:15.00 --> 1:47:30.00
violence 3 (SceneRadar: Bourne and the hit man start a brutal fist fight. They kick, punch, strange and headbutt. The hit man attacks with a knife - then starts choking Bourne. Bourne recovers and breaks his neck and kills him.)

1:49:31.62 --> 1:49:32.70
profane word 3 (son of a bitch)
